I wrote:
> 
> At Tue, 8 Sep 2009 08:46:36 +0100,
> Sophie Hamilton wrote:
> > 
> > On 9/8/09, Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de> wrote:
> > >  Sophie, what happens if you use the patch without your change?
